by><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhuāng\" data-defn=\"to adorn / to play a role / to pretend / to install / to fix / to wrap (sth in a bag) / to load / to pack\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">装</span><span class=\"tr\">裝</span><rt>zhuāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jìn qù\" data-defn=\"to go in\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">进去</span><span class=\"tr\">進去</span><rt>jìn qù</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiān\" data-defn=\"beforehand; first; earlier / at first; originally / for the time being; for now\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">先</span><span class=\"tr\">先</span><rt>xiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"cóng\" data-defn=\"from; through; via / (bound form) retainer; attendant / (bound form) assistant; auxiliary; subordinate / (bound form) related by common paternal grandfather or earlier ancestor\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">从</span><span class=\"tr\">從</span><rt>cóng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shā zi\" data-defn=\"sand / grit\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">沙子</span><span class=\"tr\">沙子</span><rt>shā zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kāi shǐ\" data-defn=\"to begin / to start\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">开始</span><span class=\"tr\">開始</span><rt>kāi shǐ</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"měi\" data-defn=\"each / every\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">每</span><span class=\"tr\">每</span><rt>měi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hái zi\" data-defn=\"child\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">孩子</span><span class=\"tr\">孩子</span><rt>hái zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dōu\" data-defn=\"all; both; entirely\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">都</span><span class=\"tr\"